# Namecoin NIP-05 (.bit domains) -- OPT-IN
# Point at a namecoind JSON-RPC endpoint, e.g. http://user:pass@127.0.0.1:8336,
# to enable `.bit` NIP-05 resolution. When unset, `.bit` handles simply fail
# to resolve (same observable behavior as an unreachable DNS host). Regular
# DNS-based NIP-05 is unaffected.
